  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.1\n\n            - Added NormalizeUnicodeCompat() for curated Unicode compatibility and variant mappings without applying the CJK Compatibility Ideograph table.\n            - Requires native opencc_normalize_unicode_compat (v0.13.1.0 or later), available in all bundled runtimes.\n            - Added regression coverage distinguishing all three normalizers and checking input validation, disposal, Unicode preservation, repeated calls, and native error handling.\n            - Refined public and native XML documentation, README examples, and normalization/version guidance.\n            - Preserved opt-in normalization and existing conversion behavior.\n            - Updated C API native.",
